{"4120010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tank Marauder", "steam_appid": 4120010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Retro-Futuristic Tank Pilot Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the driver’s seat in a first-person tactical simulation inspired by the legendary wireframe arcade classics. Pilot a high-tech combat vehicle through a digital realm built from raw vector lines, where every movement and every shot is executed from an immersive cockpit perspective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Ultimate War Machine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, Tank Marauder is a roguelike where no two runs are the same. You are not just piloting a tank - you are constructing it. Throughout your journey, you will have the opportunity to build and evolve your own combat vehicle from the ground up. Each decision allows you to craft a unique vision of your machine, ensuring that every session offers a fresh challenge and a completely different way to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Retro-Futuristic Tank Pilot Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the driver’s seat in a first-person tactical simulation inspired by the legendary wireframe arcade classics. Pilot a high-tech combat vehicle through a digital realm built from raw vector lines, where every movement and every shot is executed from an immersive cockpit perspective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Ultimate War Machine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, Tank Marauder is a roguelike where no two runs are the same. You are not just piloting a tank - you are constructing it. Throughout your journey, you will have the opportunity to build and evolve your own combat vehicle from the ground up. Each decision allows you to craft a unique vision of your machine, ensuring that every session offers a fresh challenge and a completely different way to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Tank Marauder is first-person Action Roguelike with retro vector graphics. Each run is unique - upgrades change your gameplay, from an indestructible juggernaut to long-range artillery. In this fast paced game build your tank, adapt, and survive. What lingers in the depths of the wireframe?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120010/8605d0190629722adc71ec7e02ae8f6b48bceb66/header.jpg?t=1782336705", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120010/1067ec6dd50f1312bc3ffd8f80023d8d94aab0c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782336705", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120010/1067ec6dd50f1312bc3ffd8f80023d8d94aab0c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782336705", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Kediro"], "publishers": ["Kediro"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120010/f412c0e4fd8eb2174eae8886b360b7e1749123fc/ss_f412c0e4fd8eb2174eae8886b360b7e1749123fc.600x338.jpg?t=1782336705", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.st